  "aboutDeliveryFreeTitle": "Free Delivery & Assembly",
  "aboutDeliveryZonesLabel": "Our Free Service Areas:",
  "aboutDeliveryZonesList": "• Our İçerenköy neighborhood\n• Fındıklı, Kayışdağı, Küçükbakkalköy\n• Nearby neighbors like İnönü and Bostancı Sanayi",
  "aboutDeliveryNote": "Important Note: To protect our craftsman's health, we unfortunately cannot carry items up to high floors in buildings without an elevator. Thank you for your understanding.",
